    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The classical game of chess... now played in the <strong>Wild West!</strong> Play chess against your friends or versus the computer, unlock new scenarios and chess pieces, and prove yourself to be the wildest gunslinger in the Old West! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Play against the computer with 3 different difficult levels;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Unlock up to 12 beautiful scenarios for you to play in;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Unlock 2 more Chess Pieces, with more elaborate designs and armor;  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Play against your friends locally or just have fun against the computer;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Originally composed soundtrack to get you in the mood.</p></li></ul>",
